A||||16||JohnsFiero||School project help for my daughter||||10||
Z||000000||JohnsFiero||09-09-2000||02:29 PM||||My daughter (another Fiero fanatic) has an email project to learn longitude and lattitude.  If you could take a couple of minutes and email her a little note about where you are so she can map it, it would be greatly appreciated.  Here is the letter she sent out:<P>Hello, my name is Alexis.  I live in Superior, CO, USA, about 30 miles north of Denver, and about 10 miles south of Boulder.  For my social studies class, and practice with longitude and lattitude, my teacher has assigned a project asking me to map an email project.  We are curious to see where in the world my email will travel by internet between September 8, 2000 and October 20, 2000.  I need your help to do this.  If you receive this message, please:  <BR> <BR>1)  Email me back and tell me your location, state, and country so I can put it on my map. <BR> <BR>2)  Send my letter onto everyone you know and tell them to send it on to everyone they know.  <BR> <BR>Thank you for your time and help.  <BR> <BR>Alexis Patterson/Jaconetty<BR> <BR>My email address is  <A HREF="mailto:jaconetty@hotmail.com">jaconetty@hotmail.com</A>  <P>Thanks for your help everybody<P>John<P>||||reg||10
Z||000001||JohnsFiero||09-10-2000||12:05 AM||||Thanks to all who have helped so far - keep 'em coming.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>John||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||09-10-2000||01:29 AM||||I just emailed you/her.  I didn't email this to everyone I know because it might not be welcome.  (Kind of like spam but with good intentions. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)  I hope this helps.  Let us know what kind of grade she got.||||reg||1
Z||000003||JohnsFiero||09-10-2000||01:52 AM||||Thanks Monkeyman.  I didn't like the idea of forwarding it to everyone either, so I decided to put it up here and let everybody decide what they wanted to do.  I figured with 1300+ members she would get some pretty good responses.  13 and counting so far  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Where are all the out of country-ers?<P>John||||reg||1
