Z||000011||Robert||09-12-2000||07:35 PM||||I sent mine in and already got a nice reply back.  I was the first person from the “Great State of California” to email in. I couldn’t believe it, 6 Billion people live here, mostly in the Bay Area, and I’m the only one to send in a message.  Come on everyone, get with it.  If just the members of the Golden Gate Fiero’s alone sent in one message each, all the computers of the world would lock up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://canterburytrails.com/photo/T2.GIF"> ||||reg||10
