Z||000014||JohnsFiero||09-12-2000||11:22 PM||||I have to say thanks again to all the forum members who have responded.  We now have responses from Japan, Australia, and Canada.  I cannot believe all the words of encouragement and the support for this!  Lexi's eyes just grow when she reads all the facts and tidbits from around the world.   Again, you don't have to forward it, just a quick note stating your city and state would be great.  Thanks again  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>John  ||||reg||1
